    "Nightfall source code is licensed under MIT. Videos, recordings and their preview frames retain their separate licenses, including CC BY, CC0 and public-domain notices. Attribution, source links, license links and modifications are provided in the app’s Media sources & licenses page and on this website’s Credits page. The code license does not grant ownership of third-party media, nor imply endorsement by creators or NASA.": "Nightfall 源代碼使用 MIT 許可。影片、錄音及對應預覽幀保留各自許可，包括 CC BY、CC0 與公有領域聲明。應用的素材來源與授權頁及官網素材署名頁提供作者、來源、許可鏈接與修改說明。代碼許可不授予第三方素材所有權，也不表示創作者或 NASA 為本應用背書。",
    "Less light.\nMore evening.": "少一點亮光。\n多一點夜晚。",
