    "Apple handles purchases and applicable App Store terms. To request a refund, use reportaproblem.apple.com or Apple Support. Refund eligibility is determined by Apple and applicable law; these terms do not remove your statutory rights. Product availability may depend on your region, Apple account settings and Apple approval. If products cannot load, all free features remain available.": "Apple 處理支付，相關 App Store 條款適用。申請退款請訪問 reportaproblem.apple.com 或聯繫 Apple 支持。退款資格由 Apple 與適用法律決定，本條款不影響你的法定權利。內購是否可用取決於地區、Apple 帳號設置及 Apple 審核狀態。商品無法加載時，所有免費功能仍可使用。",
