    "Where are larger downloads?": "高畫質和高音質內容在哪裡？",
    "US reference prices. Apple displays your local price before purchase. No subscription or extra features. Tips are purchased only inside the app.": "以上為美國基準價格，實際購買前由 Apple 顯示當地價格。沒有訂閱，不增加功能。贊助僅通過 App 內購買。",
    "This site is hosted by GitHub Pages over HTTPS, uses local fonts and assets, and sets no analytics cookies. GitHub may retain standard access logs; see docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement. Apple’s policy is available at apple.com/legal/privacy. Following an external link subjects that visit to its provider’s policy.": "官網由 GitHub Pages 通過 HTTPS 托管，字體與素材為本站資源，不設置統計 Cookie。GitHub 可能保留正常訪問日誌，詳見 docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement。Apple 隱私政策見 apple.com/legal/privacy。打開外部鏈接後，該服務的政策適用於此次訪問。",
    "Support and changes": "聯繫與變更",
    "Original source ↗": "原始來源 ↗",
