    "Material changes will be posted here with a new effective date. Purchase terms displayed by Apple apply at purchase time. You can stop using the app at any time. For questions or issues, use the public GitHub project; do not post confidential or financial information.": "實質性條款變更會在此發佈並更新生效日期。購買時以 Apple 展示的購買條款為準。你可隨時停止使用應用。問題可通過公開 GitHub 項目聯繫，請勿提交機密或財務資料。",
