    "Find your quiet ↓": "尋找你的安靜 ↓",
    "features free": "功能免費，無廣告",
    "Selected excerpt; cropped to 16:9 where required without upscaling; silent H.264 at 24 fps. Preview frame resized from this excerpt.": "選取片段；必要時裁為 16:9，不放大分辨率；靜音 H.264、24 fps。預覽圖由該片段縮小獲得。",
    "Optional media are downloaded only when you choose Download. They are hosted in the public NightfallTV GitHub Releases repository. GitHub and its delivery providers receive ordinary connection information, such as IP address, time and user agent. Photo requests go directly to the HTTPS hosts you specify; those hosts may receive the same connection information and any parameters in your chosen URL. We do not proxy or upload your photos.": "可選媒體僅在你選擇下載後獲取，托管於公開的 NightfallTV GitHub Releases 倉庫。GitHub 及其分發服務會接收 IP 地址、訪問時間、客戶端標識等正常連接信息。個人照片直接請求你指定的 HTTPS 網站；對方可能接收上述連接信息及照片地址中的參數。我們不代理或上傳你的照片。",
    "Terms of use": "服務條款",
    "Help": "幫助",
    "A different view of the world, filmed from above.": "從空中凝望山谷與流雲，Danny Rest 實拍。",
    "A sound of your own": "混合屬於你的聲音",
    "How do I install it?": "如何安裝？",
    "All app features and media downloads are free. Optional developer tips are one-time consumable purchases, with US reference amounts of USD 0.99, 2.99, 4.99 and 9.99. Apple’s purchase sheet shows the actual local price and applicable taxes. There is no subscription, automatic renewal, purchased entitlement or additional content. Repeat tips require a new, explicit purchase. Completed consumable tips cannot be restored as an entitlement; your Apple account retains its transaction records.": "所有應用功能與媒體下載均免費。開發者贊助為可自願重復購買的一次性消耗型內購，美國基準金額為 0.99、2.99、4.99 與 9.99 美元。實際當地價格及適用稅費以 Apple 購買界面為準。沒有訂閱、自動續費、購買權益或額外付費內容。每次再次贊助均需主動購買。已完成的消耗型贊助不作為權益恢復；Apple 帳號保留交易記錄。",
    "Choose optional 4K films and 48 kHz lossless recordings. See sizes, cancel, or remove them anytime.": "自行選擇下載 4K 實拍或 48 kHz 無損錄音。顯示容量與進度，可取消、可刪除。",
    "Media retain their own licenses. Code and generated colored noise are MIT. Preview frames use the same license as their source film. No endorsement by the creators is implied.": "媒體保留各自許可。代碼與生成的有色噪音為 MIT。預覽幀使用原影片的同一許可。不代表創作者為應用背書。",
    "Optional media require an internet connection and device storage. tvOS caches can be removed by the system; downloading again is free, subject to host availability. Files are integrity-checked before being marked ready. Only add photographs you have rights or permission to display, and use HTTPS URLs you trust. Avoid private credentials in photo links.": "可選媒體下載需要網絡和設備空間。tvOS 可能清理快取；在托管服務可用的情況下，重新下載免費。文件經過完整性校驗後才標記為可用。請僅添加有權或獲授權展示的照片，並使用可信的 HTTPS 地址，避免在照片鏈接中放入私人憑據。",
    "Credits": "素材署名",
    "If you open a GitHub issue, its contents are public and processed by GitHub. Do not include passwords, payment details or private photo URLs. No personal information is required to use Nightfall. We do not knowingly collect information from children. Material policy changes will update the effective date here. Privacy questions can be raised through the project’s GitHub issues.": "GitHub issue 的內容是公開的，並由 GitHub 處理。請勿填寫密碼、支付資料或私人照片地址。使用 Nightfall 無需提供個人信息，我們不會故意收集兒童信息。政策實質變更會更新本頁生效日期。隱私問題可通過項目 GitHub issues 聯繫。",
