    "Start a video or soundscape, then choose Picture off in the player. Audio continues with a black picture. Select shows controls; Back returns to the app. Nightfall cannot turn off your TV backlight.": "開始播放影片或聲景，再在播放器選擇「關閉畫面」。畫面變黑，聲音繼續。確認鍵顯示控制，返回鍵回到應用程式。Nightfall 無法關閉電視背光。",
    "Nightfall TV plays nature videos, soundscapes and personal photos on Apple TV. Playback starts only when you choose it. Picture-off and sleep timers apply only to your playback session. The app does not replace the system Home screen or control TV backlight or another app’s music.": "Nightfall TV 在 Apple TV 播放自然影片、聲景和個人照片。只有主動選擇後才開始播放。關畫面與睡眠定時僅作用於目前播放工作階段。應用程式不替換系統主畫面、不控制電視背光或其他應用程式音樂。",
